  "created": "2025-03-28T16:40:41.225Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A lot of people have expressed concern over the new \"audio from camera\" feature and that it could potentially be used to stalk/eavesdrop. I think making it so the red camera location is obvious and can be seen through walls would help make it way harder to eavesdrop. Have it work like how it does before, where the indicator only shows when the menu is open, just through walls as well. I wouldn't be against the camera indicator being forced on (e.g. even when menu is closed) when audio from camera is on though.",
